{"id":"658781","name":"客家蒜头焖猪肉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658781/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"刀肉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"蒜头","amount":"1扎"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1g"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"20g"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"南乳酱","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"五香粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"开水","amount":"500ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"刀肉（或五花肉）切大块，不喜欢太肥所以用了刀肉。","img":"images/658781/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"自家姐姐种的红皮蒜头，特别香，剥洗干净。","img":"images/658781/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用酱油、蚝油、老抽、南乳酱调一个酱汁。","img":"images/658781/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅热油，刀肉入锅煎热。","img":"images/658781/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎至表面泛黄。","img":"images/658781/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入盐、冰糖、料酒，翻炒入味。","img":"images/658781/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入酱汁。","img":"images/658781/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入五香粉和胡椒粉增香。","img":"images/658781/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入蒜头。","img":"images/658781/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入开水与肉持平。","img":"images/658781/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖盖焖半小时。","img":"images/658781/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到，收汁出锅。","img":"images/658781/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658781/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}